+## Delegation issuance duty
+
+The dedicated delegation_issuer has SELECT on delegation grants and revocations,
+and INSERT on delegation grants only. It has no grant UPDATE/DELETE or revocation
+INSERT duty. The receiver retains SELECT-only access to both tables. Both
+original and partitioned inventory profiles include this thirteenth login;
+partitioned lifecycle tables grant it no access. Migration still requires an
+exact, distinct set of registered runtime roles.
+
+The receiving process currently holds the issuer credential because the composed
+grant store serves issuance and at-effect reads. This establishes database-role
+separation, not process isolation. Grant-revocation writing is not enabled.
 
